# AktifDesk – Windows build notes
#
# * flutter_secure_storage is used for secrets on Android only. On Windows,
#   PlatformSecretStore (lib/app/secret_store.dart) keeps secrets in
#   SharedPreferences instead (user-profile scoped, not encrypted).
# * The flutter_secure_storage_windows native plugin is still registered and
#   compiled by Flutter on Windows because the package is a dependency. It
#   includes <atlstr.h>, so the Visual Studio "C++ ATL" component must be
#   installed (it is present on the GitHub Actions windows-2022 image).
# * The executable is named AktifDesk.exe (BINARY_NAME in CMakeLists.txt).
